<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1001> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasName> "Operating Expenses" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1001> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Operating Expenses"@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1001> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasDescription> "Value of expenditures incurred by the organization as a result of performing its normal business operations during the reporting period." .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1001> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Value of expenditures incurred by the organization as a result of performing its normal business operations during the reporting period."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1001> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasIdentifier> "FP1001" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1001> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "FP1001" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1001> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#hadPrimarySource> <https://iris.thegiin.org/metric/5.3/FP1001/> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1001> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "This metric is intended to capture the organization’s operating expenses. For financial services organizations, this metric should not include Financial Expenses (FP2553) or provisions for loan losses, which should be reported under Impairment Loss Allowance (FP2392)."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1001> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#definedBy> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#giin> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1001> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasSpecification> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
