<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1129> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#Code> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1129> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasName> "Loans Receivable Net" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1129> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Loans Receivable Net"@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1129> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasDescription> "Net value of the organization's loans receivable as of the end of the reporting period." .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1129> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Net value of the organization's loans receivable as of the end of the reporting period."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1129> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasIdentifier> "FP1129" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1129> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "FP1129" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1129> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#hadPrimarySource> <https://iris.thegiin.org/metric/5.3/FP1129/> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1129> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "This metric is intended to capture the value, as of the end of the reporting period, of loans receivable held by the organization net of loans written down in value."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1129> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#definedBy> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#giin> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1129> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasSpecification> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1129> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1129> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
