<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1192> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#Code> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1192> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasName> "Loan to Deposit (LTD) Ratio" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1192> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Loan to Deposit (LTD) Ratio"@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1192> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasDescription> "Ratio between the organization's loans receivable gross and its total deposits as of the end of the reporting period, used to assess an organization's liquidity." .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1192> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Ratio between the organization's loans receivable gross and its total deposits as of the end of the reporting period, used to assess an organization's liquidity."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1192> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasIdentifier> "FP1192" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1192> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "FP1192" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1192> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#hadPrimarySource> <https://iris.thegiin.org/metric/5.3/FP1192/> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1192> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "This metric is intended to capture a measure of a bank or other financial institution’s liquidity: the ratio of loans granted (receivable) to deposits held."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1192> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#definedBy> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#giin> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1192> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasSpecification> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1192> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1192> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
