<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1301> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#Code> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1301> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasName> "Net Income" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1301> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Net Income"@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1301> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasDescription> "Value of the organization's net profit, calculated as total income minus total expenses, taxes, and cost of goods sold during the reporting period."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1301> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Value of the organization's net profit, calculated as total income minus total expenses, taxes, and cost of goods sold during the reporting period."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1301> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasIdentifier> "FP1301" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1301> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "FP1301" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1301> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#hadPrimarySource> <https://iris.thegiin.org/metric/5.3/FP1301/> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1301> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "This metric is intended to capture the organization’s net profit, also sometimes termed bottom line or net earnings."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1301> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#definedBy> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#giin> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1301> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasSpecification> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1301> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1301> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1307> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1307> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#Code> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1307> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasName> "Capital Available: Total" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1307> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Capital Available: Total"@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1307> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasDescription> "Value of capital available to the organization for lending and investing as of the end of the reporting period." .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1307> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Value of capital available to the organization for lending and investing as of the end of the reporting period."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1307> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasIdentifier> "FP1307" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1307> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "FP1307" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1307> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#hadPrimarySource> <https://iris.thegiin.org/metric/5.3/FP1307/> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1307> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "This metric is intended to capture the amount of capital the organization can deploy as of the end of the reporting period. This capital can come from debt or equity investments in the organization."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1307> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#definedBy> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#giin> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1307> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasSpecification> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1307> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1307> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1657> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1657> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#Code> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1657> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasName> "EBITDA" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1657> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "EBITDA"@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1657> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasDescription> "Value of the organization's net income before interest, taxes, depreciation, and amortization during the reporting period.\n\nEBITDA signifies Earnings Before Interest, Taxes, Depreciation, and Amortization." .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1657> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Value of the organization's net income before interest, taxes, depreciation, and amortization during the reporting period.\n\nEBITDA signifies Earnings Before Interest, Taxes, Depreciation, and Amortization."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1657> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasIdentifier> "FP1657" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1657> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "FP1657" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1657> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#hadPrimarySource> <https://iris.thegiin.org/metric/5.3/FP1657/> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1657> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "This metric is intended to capture the organization’s net income before interest, taxes, depreciation, and amortization during the reporting period, a common measure of business health that normalizes for capital structure (that is, independent of the ratio of debt to equity)."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1657> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#definedBy> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#giin> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1657> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasSpecification> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1657> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1657> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1717> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1717> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#Code> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1717> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasName> "Impaired Assets" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1717> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Impaired Assets"@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1717> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasDescription> "Value of assets classified as impaired under regulatory or accounting rules and recorded by the organization during the reporting period." .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1717> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Value of assets classified as impaired under regulatory or accounting rules and recorded by the organization during the reporting period."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1717> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasIdentifier> "FP1717" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1717> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "FP1717" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1717> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#hadPrimarySource> <https://iris.thegiin.org/metric/5.3/FP1717/> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1717> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "This metric is intended to capture an organization’s impaired assets, which have market value below their carrying cost and are not expected to recover."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1717> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#definedBy> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#giin> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1717> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasSpecification> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1717> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1717> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1996> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1996> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#Code> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1996> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasName> "Total Liabilities" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1996> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Total Liabilities"@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1996> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasDescription> "Value of the organization’s liabilities as of the end of the reporting period." .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1996> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Value of the organization’s liabilities as of the end of the reporting period."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1996> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasIdentifier> "FP1996" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1996> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "FP1996" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1996> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#hadPrimarySource> <https://iris.thegiin.org/metric/5.3/FP1996/> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP1996> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "This metric is intended to capture the value of the organization’s total liabilities, which include all debts and other obligations regardless of expected time of settlement."@en .
