<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2321> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#Code> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2321> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasName> "Total Expenses" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2321> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Total Expenses"@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2321> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasDescription> "Value of all expenditures incurred by the organization during the reporting period." .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2321> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Value of all expenditures incurred by the organization during the reporting period."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2321> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasIdentifier> "FP2321" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2321> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "FP2321" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2321> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#hadPrimarySource> <https://iris.thegiin.org/metric/5.3/FP2321/> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2321> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "This metric is intended to capture all expenses incurred by the organization. For insurance providers, this metric excludes claims payments."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2321> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#definedBy> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#giin> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2321> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasSpecification> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2321> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2321> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2392> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2392> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#Code> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2392> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasName> "Impairment Loss Allowance" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2392> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Impairment Loss Allowance"@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2392> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasDescription> "Value of the organization’s contra asset account set up as a provision for a potential future loss of capital that has been lent out by the organization as of the end of the reporting period." .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2392> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Value of the organization’s contra asset account set up as a provision for a potential future loss of capital that has been lent out by the organization as of the end of the reporting period."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2392> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasIdentifier> "FP2392" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2392> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "FP2392" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2392> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#hadPrimarySource> <https://iris.thegiin.org/metric/5.3/FP2392/> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2392> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "This metric is intended to capture the reduction in the recoverable amount of a fixed asset below its book value."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2392> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#definedBy> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#giin> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2392> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasSpecification> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2392> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2392> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2460> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2460> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#Code> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2460> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasName> "Gross Incurred Claims" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2460> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Gross Incurred Claims"@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2460> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasDescription> "Value of the organization’s gross incurred claims as of the end of the reporting period." .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2460> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Value of the organization’s gross incurred claims as of the end of the reporting period."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2460> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasIdentifier> "FP2460" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2460> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "FP2460" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2460> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#hadPrimarySource> <https://iris.thegiin.org/metric/5.3/FP2460/> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2460> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "This metric is intended to capture incurred claims, which occur when an insured event has happened for which the insurer may be liable if a claim is made. An insurer is usually not aware of all incurred claims in real time or for a current accounting period.\n\nIncurred claims include all gross paid claims during the period, plus a reasonable estimate of unpaid liabilities. Unpaid liabilities can be calculated as a sum of the change in reserves (including the reserve of claims incurred but not reported), course of settlement reserve, and accrued liabilities reserve.\n\nThis metric is used in calculating Incurred Claims Ratio (FP8478), which helps assess the value of an insurance product per premium paid."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2460> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "Organizations should footnote all assumptions used. See usage guidance for further information."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2460> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#definedBy> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#giin> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2460> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasSpecification> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2460> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2460> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2553> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2553> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#Code> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2553> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasName> "Financial Expenses" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2553> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Financial Expenses"@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2553> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasDescription> "Value of expenditures incurred by the organization during the reporting period to settle interest, fees, and commissions incurred on the organization’s financial liabilities—including, among others, any client deposit accounts held by the organization, borrowings, and subordinated debt." .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2553> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Value of expenditures incurred by the organization during the reporting period to settle interest, fees, and commissions incurred on the organization’s financial liabilities—including, among others, any client deposit accounts held by the organization, borrowings, and subordinated debt."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2553> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasIdentifier> "FP2553" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2553> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "FP2553" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2553> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#hadPrimarySource> <https://iris.thegiin.org/metric/5.3/FP2553/> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2553> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "This metric is intended to capture all costs incurred by the organization during the reporting period that are associated with its financial liabilities, such as interest, fees, and commissions."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2553> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#definedBy> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#giin> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2553> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasSpecification> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2553> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2553> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2630> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2630> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#Code> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2630> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasName> "Loans Receivable Gross" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2630> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Loans Receivable Gross"@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2630> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasDescription> "Value of outstanding principal for all of the organization’s outstanding loans due from clients as of the end of the reporting period." .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2630> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Value of outstanding principal for all of the organization’s outstanding loans due from clients as of the end of the reporting period."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2630> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasIdentifier> "FP2630" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2630> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "FP2630" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2630> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#hadPrimarySource> <https://iris.thegiin.org/metric/5.3/FP2630/> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2630> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "This metric is intended to capture principal outstanding owed by clients as of the end of the reporting period. It should include current, delinquent, and renegotiated loans, but not loans that have been written off. It should not include interest receivable."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2630> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#definedBy> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#giin> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2630> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasSpecification> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2630> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2630> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2635> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2635> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#Code> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2635> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasName> "Non-Performing Loans (Portfolio at Risk): 30 Days" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2635> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Non-Performing Loans (Portfolio at Risk): 30 Days"@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2635> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasDescription> "Value of the organization’s loans outstanding, as of the end of the reporting period, with one or more installments of principal past due for more than 30 days." .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2635> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Value of the organization’s loans outstanding, as of the end of the reporting period, with one or more installments of principal past due for more than 30 days."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2635> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasIdentifier> "FP2635" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2635> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "FP2635" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2635> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#hadPrimarySource> <https://iris.thegiin.org/metric/5.3/FP2635/> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2635> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "This metric is intended to capture total principal past due by 30 days as of the end of the reporting period. Organizations should report the entire unpaid principal balance, including both past due and future installments, but they should not report accrued interest. This metric should also include loans that have been restructured or rescheduled."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2635> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#definedBy> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#giin> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2635> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasSpecification> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2635> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2635> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2638> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2638> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#Code> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2638> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasName> "Capital Available: Borrowed Funds" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2638> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Capital Available: Borrowed Funds"@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2638> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasDescription> "Value of capital available to the organization for lending and investing as of the end of the reporting period that is attributed to debt obligations on the organization’s balance sheet." .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2638> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Value of capital available to the organization for lending and investing as of the end of the reporting period that is attributed to debt obligations on the organization’s balance sheet."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2638> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasIdentifier> "FP2638" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2638> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "FP2638" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2638> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#hadPrimarySource> <https://iris.thegiin.org/metric/5.3/FP2638/> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2638> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "This metric is intended to capture borrowed capital available to the organization for deployment as of the end of the reporting period. This metric should include debt obligations with equity characteristics."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2638> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#definedBy> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#giin> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2638> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasSpecification> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2638> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2638> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2651> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2651> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#Code> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2651> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasName> "Return on Equity (ROE)" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2651> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Return on Equity (ROE)"@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2651> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasDescription> "Value of an organization’s net profit generated per dollar of shareholders’ equity during the reporting period.\n\nThis is a profitability ratio calculated as net income divided by average total equity or net assets." .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2651> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Value of an organization’s net profit generated per dollar of shareholders’ equity during the reporting period.\n\nThis is a profitability ratio calculated as net income divided by average total equity or net assets."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2651> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasIdentifier> "FP2651" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2651> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "FP2651" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2651> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#hadPrimarySource> <https://iris.thegiin.org/metric/5.3/FP2651/> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2651> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "This metric is intended to capture the profit the organization generated on shareholder’s equity during the reporting period."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2651> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#definedBy> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#giin> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2651> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasSpecification> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2651> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2651> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2852> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2852> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#Code> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2852> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasName> "Accounts Payable" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2852> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Accounts Payable"@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2852> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasDescription> "Value, as of the end of the reporting period, of all outstanding debts that must be paid by the organization within a given period of time in order to avoid default." .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2852> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Value, as of the end of the reporting period, of all outstanding debts that must be paid by the organization within a given period of time in order to avoid default."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2852> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasIdentifier> "FP2852" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2852> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "FP2852" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2852> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#hadPrimarySource> <https://iris.thegiin.org/metric/5.3/FP2852/> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2852> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "This metric is intended to capture the value of accounts payable by the organization, which are debts the organization owes that will be paid in the future according to negotiated terms."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2852> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#definedBy> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#giin> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2852> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasSpecification> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2852> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP2852> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3021> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3021> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#Code> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3021> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasName> "Revenue from Grants and Donations" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3021> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Revenue from Grants and Donations"@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3021> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasDescription> "Value of revenue contributed as grants and donations during the reporting period." .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3021> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Value of revenue contributed as grants and donations during the reporting period."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3021> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasIdentifier> "FP3021" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3021> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "FP3021" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3021> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#hadPrimarySource> <https://iris.thegiin.org/metric/5.3/FP3021/> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3021> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "This metric is intended to capture revenue from both unrestricted and restricted operating grants and donations. It should not include equity grants for capital, grants intended for future operating periods, or grants that will be passed through to other organizations. Organizations should recognize grant revenue on a systematic basis as income over the periods necessary to match them with the related costs which the grants are intended to compensate. If a grant relates to expenses already incurred and no future related costs are expected, the grant should be recognized as income in the period during which it becomes receivable.\n\nThis metric should include only financial grants and donations received and not the value of in-kind donations."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3021> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#definedBy> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#giin> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3021> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasSpecification> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3021> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3021> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3274> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3274> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#Code> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3274> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasName> "Net Income Before Donations" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3274> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Net Income Before Donations"@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3274> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasDescription> "Value of the organization's net profit before donations, calculated as total income (excluding donations) minus total expenses during the reporting period." .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3274> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Value of the organization's net profit before donations, calculated as total income (excluding donations) minus total expenses during the reporting period."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3274> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasIdentifier> "FP3274" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3274> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "FP3274" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3274> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#hadPrimarySource> <https://iris.thegiin.org/metric/5.3/FP3274/> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3274> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "This metric is intended to capture the organization’s income without including donations (such as grant support, philanthropic capital not expecting any repayment, or any form of individual giving) during the reporting period."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3274> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#definedBy> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#giin> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3274> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasSpecification> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3274> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3274> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3297> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3297> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#Code> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3297> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasName> "Income Growth" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3297> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Income Growth"@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3297> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasDescription> "Percentage growth in the value of the organization’s net income from one reporting period to another." .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3297> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Percentage growth in the value of the organization’s net income from one reporting period to another."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3297> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasIdentifier> "FP3297" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3297> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "FP3297" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3297> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#hadPrimarySource> <https://iris.thegiin.org/metric/5.3/FP3297/> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3297> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "This metric is intended to capture growth in net income. Organizations receiving substantial revenue from grants/donations under Revenue from Grants and Donations (FP3021) should instead use Net Income Before Donations (FP3274) in this calculation."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3297> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#definedBy> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#giin> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3297> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasSpecification> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3297> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3297> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3466> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3466> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#Code> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3466> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasName> "Cash Flow: Net Total" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3466> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Cash Flow: Net Total"@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3466> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasDescription> "Value of the organization’s net cash flow during the reporting period. Net cash flow equals inflows less outflows of cash and cash equivalents from operating, investing, financing, and other activities." .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3466> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Value of the organization’s net cash flow during the reporting period. Net cash flow equals inflows less outflows of cash and cash equivalents from operating, investing, financing, and other activities."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3466> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasIdentifier> "FP3466" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3466> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "FP3466" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3466> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#hadPrimarySource> <https://iris.thegiin.org/metric/5.3/FP3466/> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3466> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "This metric is intended to capture the net cash flow to the organization during the reporting period."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3466> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#definedBy> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#giin> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3466> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasSpecification> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3466> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3466> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3673> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3673> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#Code> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3673> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasName> "EBIT" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3673> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "EBIT"@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3673> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasDescription> "Value of the organization's net income before interest and taxes during the reporting period.\n\nEBIT signifies Earnings Before Interest and Taxes." .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3673> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Value of the organization's net income before interest and taxes during the reporting period.\n\nEBIT signifies Earnings Before Interest and Taxes."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3673> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasIdentifier> "FP3673" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3673> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "FP3673" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3673> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#hadPrimarySource> <https://iris.thegiin.org/metric/5.3/FP3673/> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3673> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "This metric is intended to capture the organization’s net income before interest and taxes during the reporting period."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3673> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#definedBy> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#giin> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3673> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasSpecification> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3673> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3673> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3774> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3774> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#Code> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3774> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasName> "Charitable Donations" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3774> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Charitable Donations"@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3774> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasDescription> "Value of all financial contributions and in-kind donations of goods and services made by the organization to charities, private foundations, non-profit organizations, or non-governmental organizations during the reporting period." .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3774> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Value of all financial contributions and in-kind donations of goods and services made by the organization to charities, private foundations, non-profit organizations, or non-governmental organizations during the reporting period."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3774> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasIdentifier> "FP3774" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3774> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "FP3774" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3774> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#hadPrimarySource> <https://iris.thegiin.org/metric/5.3/FP3774/> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3774> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "Organizations should footnote all assumptions used. See usage guidance for further information."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3774> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "This metric is intended to capture charitable donations given, not received, by the organization.\n\nIn-kind donations are in the form of goods and/or services rather than money (e.g., donating food and clothing for natural hazard victims). Pricing discounts (e.g. to non-profits) should not be used as part of this metric; only free services are considered to be in-kind donations. The monetary equivalent of pro bono services provided can be included as in-kind donations; however, \"low bono\" services are considered to be pricing discounts and should not be included. Organizations are encouraged to footnote their method for calculating the value of in-kind donations.\n\nDonations made to organizations that service political causes, despite their non-profit status, should be excluded.\n\nOrganizations are encouraged to report this metric in conjunction with Community Service Hours Contributed (OI8429), which are not considered in-kind donations, and Charitable Practices (OI7421)."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3774> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#definedBy> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#giin> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3774> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasSpecification> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3774> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3774> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3939> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3939> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#Code> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3939> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasName> "Loans Recovered" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3939> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Loans Recovered"@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3939> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasDescription> "Value of loans collected by the organization during the reporting period that had previously been written off." .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3939> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Value of loans collected by the organization during the reporting period that had previously been written off."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3939> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasIdentifier> "FP3939" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3939> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "FP3939" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3939> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#hadPrimarySource> <https://iris.thegiin.org/metric/5.3/FP3939/> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3939> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "This metric is intended to capture the value of loans owed the organization that it collected during the reporting period but that it had previously written off as bad debt."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3939> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#definedBy> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#giin> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3939> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasSpecification> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3939> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP3939> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4224> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4224> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#Code> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4224> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasName> "Working Capital Ratio" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4224> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Working Capital Ratio"@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4224> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasDescription> "Ratio of the organization’s current assets compared to current liabilities as of the end of the reporting period." .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4224> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Ratio of the organization’s current assets compared to current liabilities as of the end of the reporting period."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4224> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasIdentifier> "FP4224" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4224> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "FP4224" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4224> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#hadPrimarySource> <https://iris.thegiin.org/metric/5.3/FP4224/> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4224> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "This metric is intended to capture the organization’s working capital position. This ratio is commonly termed the Current Ratio or Net Working Capital."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4224> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#definedBy> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#giin> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4224> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasSpecification> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4224> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4224> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4326> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4326> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#Code> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4326> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasName> "Return on Assets (ROA)" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4326> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Return on Assets (ROA)"@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4326> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasDescription> "Value of an organization’s net profit after taxes generated per dollar invested in total assets as of the end of the reporting period.\n\nThis is a profitability ratio calculated as net income less taxes, divided by average total assets." .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4326> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Value of an organization’s net profit after taxes generated per dollar invested in total assets as of the end of the reporting period.\n\nThis is a profitability ratio calculated as net income less taxes, divided by average total assets."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4326> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasIdentifier> "FP4326" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4326> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "FP4326" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4326> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#hadPrimarySource> <https://iris.thegiin.org/metric/5.3/FP4326/> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4326> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "This metric is intended to capture the profit after taxes the organization generated on all assets (that is, on capital in any form)."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4326> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#definedBy> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#giin> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4326> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasSpecification> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4326> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4326> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4373> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4373> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#Code> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4373> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasName> "Gross Margin" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4373> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Gross Margin"@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4373> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasDescription> "Percentage of revenue that the organization retains after incurring the direct costs associated with the production/delivery of its products/services during the reporting period." .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4373> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Percentage of revenue that the organization retains after incurring the direct costs associated with the production/delivery of its products/services during the reporting period."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4373> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasIdentifier> "FP4373" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4373> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "FP4373" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4373> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#hadPrimarySource> <https://iris.thegiin.org/metric/5.3/FP4373/> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4373> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "This metric is intended to capture gross margin during the reporting period, or the percentage profitability of a sale of products or services that incurs only direct costs (excluding, that is, costs such as operating overheads or research and development)."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4373> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#definedBy> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#giin> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4373> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasSpecification> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4373> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4373> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4649> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4649> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#Code> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4649> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasName> "Financial Assets" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4649> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Financial Assets"@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4649> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasDescription> "Value, as of the end of the reporting period, of the organization's non-physical assets such as cash, bank accounts, or other investments." .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4649> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Value, as of the end of the reporting period, of the organization's non-physical assets such as cash, bank accounts, or other investments."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4649> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasIdentifier> "FP4649" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4649> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "FP4649" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4649> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#hadPrimarySource> <https://iris.thegiin.org/metric/5.3/FP4649/> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4649> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "This metric is intended to capture the organization’s financial assets, which include debt, equity, and cash assets such as stocks, bonds, mutual funds, cash, and cash management accounts. Values of these assets should be based upon fair market value where efficient secondary markets exist; otherwise, these assets should be valued at historic cost.\n\nFinancial assets should only include non-current assets."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4649> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#definedBy> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#giin> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4649> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasSpecification> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4649> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4649> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4761> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4761> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#Code> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4761> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasName> "Revenue Growth" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4761> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Revenue Growth"@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4761> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasDescription> "Percentage growth in value of the organization's revenue from one reporting period to another." .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4761> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Percentage growth in value of the organization's revenue from one reporting period to another."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4761> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasIdentifier> "FP4761" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4761> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "FP4761" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4761> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#hadPrimarySource> <https://iris.thegiin.org/metric/5.3/FP4761/> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4761> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "This metric is intended to capture the organization’s growth in revenue. Negative values can be interpreted as the percentage decrease in revenue growth between periods."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4761> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#definedBy> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#giin> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4761> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasSpecification> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4761> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4761> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4812> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4812> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#Code> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4812> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasName> "Cash Flow: Operating Activities" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4812> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Cash Flow: Operating Activities"@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4812> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasDescription> "Value of the organization's cash flow during the reporting period related to operating activities." .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4812> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Value of the organization's cash flow during the reporting period related to operating activities."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4812> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasIdentifier> "FP4812" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4812> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "FP4812" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4812> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#hadPrimarySource> <https://iris.thegiin.org/metric/5.3/FP4812/> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4812> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "This metric is intended to capture the organization’s cash flow from operating activities during the reporting period, which are the principal revenue-producing activities of the organization and other activities that are not investing or financing activities."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4812> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#definedBy> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#giin> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4812> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasSpecification> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4812> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4812> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4831> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4831> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#Code> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4831> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasName> "Personnel Expenses" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4831> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Personnel Expenses"@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4831> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasDescription> "Value of expenditures related to personnel, including wages, benefits, trainings, and payroll taxes, incurred by the organization during the reporting period." .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4831> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Value of expenditures related to personnel, including wages, benefits, trainings, and payroll taxes, incurred by the organization during the reporting period."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4831> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasIdentifier> "FP4831" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4831> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "FP4831" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4831> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#hadPrimarySource> <https://iris.thegiin.org/metric/5.3/FP4831/> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4831> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "This metric is intended to capture the total costs paid by the organization to and on behalf of employees during the reporting period."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4831> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#definedBy> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#giin> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4831> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasSpecification> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4831> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4831> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4849> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4849> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#Code> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4849> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasName> "Non-operating Revenue" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4849> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Non-operating Revenue"@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4849> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasDescription> "Value of revenue derived from activities not related to the organization's core operations during the reporting period." .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4849> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Value of revenue derived from activities not related to the organization's core operations during the reporting period."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4849> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasIdentifier> "FP4849" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4849> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "FP4849" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4849> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#hadPrimarySource> <https://iris.thegiin.org/metric/5.3/FP4849/> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4849> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "This metric is intended to capture such items as dividend income, profits (and losses) from investments, gains (and losses) incurred due to foreign exchange, and asset write-downs, among other non-operating revenues and expenses.\n\nAs an example, for a hospital, in addition to finance-related revenue, non-operating revenue might include parking fees, revenue from the gift shop, cafeteria sales, or rental income."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4849> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#definedBy> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#giin> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4849> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasSpecification> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4849> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP4849> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5261> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5261> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#Code> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5261> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasName> "Payments to Government" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5261> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Payments to Government"@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5261> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasDescription> "Value of all transfers to governments made by the organization during the reporting period." .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5261> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Value of all transfers to governments made by the organization during the reporting period."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5261> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasIdentifier> "FP5261" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5261> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "FP5261" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5261> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#hadPrimarySource> <https://iris.thegiin.org/metric/5.3/FP5261/> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5261> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "This metric is intended to capture the funds paid to governments by the organization during the reporting period. At a minimum, this metric includes payments to governments in the form of corporate income or profit taxes. Additional forms of transfer to be reported, as relevant, include: (a) sales taxes, (b) net VAT, (c) royalties, (d) dividends and related taxes, (e) management and/or concession fees, (f) license fees, (g) tax on payment of interest, and (h) other material payments net of any direct subsidies received. Organizations should report payroll taxes under Personnel Expenses (FP4831)."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5261> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#definedBy> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#giin> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5261> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasSpecification> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5261> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5261> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5293> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5293> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#Code> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5293> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasName> "Total Assets" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5293> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Total Assets"@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5293> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasDescription> "Value, as of the end of the reporting period, of all of the organization's assets." .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5293> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Value, as of the end of the reporting period, of all of the organization's assets."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5293> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasIdentifier> "FP5293" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5293> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "FP5293" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5293> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#hadPrimarySource> <https://iris.thegiin.org/metric/5.3/FP5293/> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5293> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "This metric is intended to capture the organization’s total assets, equal to the sum of current assets plus non-current assets."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5293> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#definedBy> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#giin> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5293> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasSpecification> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5293> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5293> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5317> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5317> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#Code> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5317> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasName> "Equity or Net Assets" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5317> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Equity or Net Assets"@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5317> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasDescription> "Value of the residual interest, as of the end of the reporting period, in the assets of the organization after deducting all its liabilities." .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5317> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Value of the residual interest, as of the end of the reporting period, in the assets of the organization after deducting all its liabilities."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5317> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasIdentifier> "FP5317" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5317> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "FP5317" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5317> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#hadPrimarySource> <https://iris.thegiin.org/metric/5.3/FP5317/> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5317> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "This metric is intended to capture the organization’s net assets, also sometimes termed stockholders' or shareholders' equity."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5317> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#definedBy> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#giin> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5317> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasSpecification> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5317> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5317> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5624> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5624> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#Code> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5624> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasName> "Sales Revenue: Collected from Third Party Payers" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5624> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Sales Revenue: Collected from Third Party Payers"@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5624> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasDescription> "Value of revenue during the reporting period from sales of the organization’s products/services and collected from third-party (public or private) payers." .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5624> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Value of revenue during the reporting period from sales of the organization’s products/services and collected from third-party (public or private) payers."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5624> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasIdentifier> "FP5624" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5624> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "FP5624" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5624> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#hadPrimarySource> <https://iris.thegiin.org/metric/5.3/FP5624/> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5624> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "This metric is intended to capture the organization’s sales revenue collected from third parties. This metric may be useful for organizations that have contracts with governments and other third parties to pay for products or services delivered to end clients. For example, organizations operating in health services would include under this metric revenue from insurance reimbursements and government contracts. Organizations may find it useful to break down this metric into additional subcategories."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5624> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#definedBy> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#giin> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5624> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasSpecification> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5624> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5624> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5662> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5662> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#Code> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5662> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasName> "Capital Available: Equity Capital" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5662> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Capital Available: Equity Capital"@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5662> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasDescription> "Value of capital available to the organization for lending and investing at the end of the reporting period that is attributed to equity contributions." .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5662> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Value of capital available to the organization for lending and investing at the end of the reporting period that is attributed to equity contributions."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5662> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasIdentifier> "FP5662" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5662> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "FP5662" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5662> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#hadPrimarySource> <https://iris.thegiin.org/metric/5.3/FP5662/> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5662> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "This metric is intended to capture equity capital available to the organization for deployment as of the end of the reporting period. Organizations that are nonprofit should report permanent capital, which is calculated as net assets available for lending and investing at the end of a fiscal year."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5662> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#definedBy> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#giin> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5662> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasSpecification> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5662> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5662> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5979> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5979> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#Code> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5979> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasName> "Number of Loans Fully Repaid on Time" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5979> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Number of Loans Fully Repaid on Time"@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5979> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasDescription> "Number of the organization’s loans due for complete payback during the reporting period (but disbursed at any time) that were repaid no later than their due dates." .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5979> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Number of the organization’s loans due for complete payback during the reporting period (but disbursed at any time) that were repaid no later than their due dates."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5979> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasIdentifier> "FP5979" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5979> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "FP5979" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5979> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#hadPrimarySource> <https://iris.thegiin.org/metric/5.3/FP5979/> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5979> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Number of the organization’s loans due for complete payback during the reporting period (but disbursed at any time) that were repaid no later than their due dates."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5979> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "Organizations should footnote all assumptions used."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5979> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#definedBy> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#giin> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5979> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasSpecification> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5979> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP5979> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP6094> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP6094> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#Code> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP6094> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasName> "Long Term Financial Liabilities" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP6094> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Long Term Financial Liabilities"@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP6094> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasDescription> "Value, as of the end of the reporting period, of an organization's long-term financial liabilities." .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP6094> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Value, as of the end of the reporting period, of an organization's long-term financial liabilities."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP6094> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasIdentifier> "FP6094" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP6094> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "FP6094" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP6094> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#hadPrimarySource> <https://iris.thegiin.org/metric/5.3/FP6094/> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP6094> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "This metric is intended to capture the organization’s long-term financial liabilities, which include all borrowed funds, deposits held, and other contractual obligations to deliver cash."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP6094> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#definedBy> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#giin> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP6094> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasSpecification> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP6094> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP6094> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP6152> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP6152> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#Code> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP6152> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasName> "Solvency Ratio" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP6152> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Solvency Ratio"@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP6152> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasDescription> "Ratio of an organization’s admitted assets to liabilities, per their statutory accounts, as of the end of the reporting period." .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP6152> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Ratio of an organization’s admitted assets to liabilities, per their statutory accounts, as of the end of the reporting period."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP6152> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasIdentifier> "FP6152" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP6152> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "FP6152" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP6152> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#hadPrimarySource> <https://iris.thegiin.org/metric/5.3/FP6152/> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP6152> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "This metric is intended to capture the financial strength of an insurance program (as a ‘cover ratio’ would for international insurers). This metric is not intended to refer to Solvency I or II rules.\n\nThe Insurance Information Institute, applicable in the United States, defines admitted assets as those “that can be easily sold in the event of liquidation or borrowed against, and receivables for which payment can be reasonably anticipated.” In the absence of a regulatory definition of admitted assets applicable to their context, organizations should include in this metric higher-quality assets that can easily be liquidated.\n\nFor more detail and guidance on interpretation, see the Microinsurance Network’s Performance Indicators for Microinsurance (2nd Edition), p. 49 (https://www.social-protection.org/gimi/ShowRessource.action?id=5270/)."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP6152> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "Organizations should footnote details about their admitted assets. See usage guidance for further information."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP6152> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#definedBy> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#giin> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP6152> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasSpecification> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP6152> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP6152> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP6354> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP6354> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#Code> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP6354> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasName> "Non-Performing Loans (Portfolio at Risk): 60 Days" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP6354> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Non-Performing Loans (Portfolio at Risk): 60 Days"@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP6354> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasDescription> "Value of the organization’s loans outstanding, as of the end of the reporting period, with one or more installments of principal past due for more than 60 days." .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP6354> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Value of the organization’s loans outstanding, as of the end of the reporting period, with one or more installments of principal past due for more than 60 days."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP6354> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasIdentifier> "FP6354" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP6354> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "FP6354" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP6354> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#hadPrimarySource> <https://iris.thegiin.org/metric/5.3/FP6354/> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP6354> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "This metric is intended to capture total principal past due by 60 days as of the end of the reporting period. Organizations should report the entire unpaid principal balance, including both past due and future installments, but they should not report accrued interest. This metric should also include loans that have been restructured or rescheduled."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP6354> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#definedBy> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#giin> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP6354> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasSpecification> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP6354> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP6354> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP6373> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
