<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP6373> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasDescription> "Value of the organization’s loans outstanding, as of the end of the reporting period, with one or more installments of principal past due for more than 90 days." .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP6373> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Value of the organization’s loans outstanding, as of the end of the reporting period, with one or more installments of principal past due for more than 90 days."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP6373> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasIdentifier> "FP6373" .
