<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8244> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8244> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8293> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8293> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#Code> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8293> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasName> "New Investment Capital" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8293> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "New Investment Capital"@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8293> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasDescription> "Value of funds invested in the organization (both loans and investments) during the reporting period." .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8293> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Value of funds invested in the organization (both loans and investments) during the reporting period."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8293> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasIdentifier> "FP8293" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8293> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "FP8293" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8293> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#hadPrimarySource> <https://iris.thegiin.org/metric/5.3/FP8293/> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8293> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "This metric is intended to capture capital received by the organization from investors in the form of a loan or cash for stock during the reporting period."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8293> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#definedBy> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#giin> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8293> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasSpecification> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8293> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8293> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8295> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8295> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#Code> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8295> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasName> "Personnel Efficiency" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8295> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Personnel Efficiency"@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8295> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasDescription> "Ratio of the organization's personnel expenses compared to its loans receivable as of the end of the reporting period." .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8295> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Ratio of the organization's personnel expenses compared to its loans receivable as of the end of the reporting period."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8295> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasIdentifier> "FP8295" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8295> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "FP8295" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8295> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#hadPrimarySource> <https://iris.thegiin.org/metric/5.3/FP8295/> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8295> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "This metric is intended to capture the organization’s personnel efficiency."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8295> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#definedBy> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#giin> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8295> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasSpecification> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8295> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8295> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8300> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8300> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#Code> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8300> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasName> "Sales Revenue: Collected Directly" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8300> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Sales Revenue: Collected Directly"@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8300> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasDescription> "Value of revenue during the reporting period from sales of the organization’s products/services and collected directly from clients." .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8300> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Value of revenue during the reporting period from sales of the organization’s products/services and collected directly from clients."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8300> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasIdentifier> "FP8300" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8300> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "FP8300" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8300> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#hadPrimarySource> <https://iris.thegiin.org/metric/5.3/FP8300/> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8300> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "This metric is intended to capture the organization’s sales revenue collected directly. This metric may be useful for organizations that receive only some revenue directly from end clients. For example, organizations operating in health services will include under this metric all out-of-pocket payments paid at the time of service or purchase."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8300> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#definedBy> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#giin> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8300> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasSpecification> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8300> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8300> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8478> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8478> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#Code> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8478> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasName> "Incurred Claims Ratio" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8478> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Incurred Claims Ratio"@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8478> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasDescription> "Percentage of gross incurred claims during the reporting period relative to gross earned premiums during the same reporting period." .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8478> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Percentage of gross incurred claims during the reporting period relative to gross earned premiums during the same reporting period."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8478> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasIdentifier> "FP8478" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8478> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "FP8478" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8478> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#hadPrimarySource> <https://iris.thegiin.org/metric/5.3/FP8478/> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8478> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "This metric is intended to capture the value of products for the insured. As an example, a 70% incurred claims ratio means that for every USD 100 of premium earned in a given accounting period, USD 70 is paid back to insured in the form of benefits (claims).\n\nIncurred claims ratios should not be compared across different product types or at different stages of a product’s life cycle.\n\nFor more detail and for guidance on interpretation, see the Microinsurance Network’s Social Performance Indicators for Microinsurance, p. 16 (https://www.social-protection.org/gimi/ShowRessource.action?id=5270/)."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8478> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "Organizations should footnote all assumptions used."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8478> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#definedBy> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#giin> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8478> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasSpecification> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8478> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8478> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8569> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8569> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#Code> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8569> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasName> "Operating Efficiency" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8569> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Operating Efficiency"@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8569> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasDescription> "Ratio of the organization's operating expenses compared to its loans receivable as of the end of the reporting period." .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8569> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Ratio of the organization's operating expenses compared to its loans receivable as of the end of the reporting period."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8569> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasIdentifier> "FP8569" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8569> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "FP8569" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8569> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#hadPrimarySource> <https://iris.thegiin.org/metric/5.3/FP8569/> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8569> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "This metric is intended to capture the organization’s operating efficiency."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8569> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#definedBy> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#giin> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8569> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasSpecification> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8569> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8569> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8653> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8653> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#Code> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8653> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasName> "Retained Earnings" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8653> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Retained Earnings"@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8653> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasDescription> "Value of the sum of the organization's profits, cumulative from inception to the end of the reporting period, not paid out as dividends but retained by the organization for reinvestment in its core business or to pay down debt." .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8653> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Value of the sum of the organization's profits, cumulative from inception to the end of the reporting period, not paid out as dividends but retained by the organization for reinvestment in its core business or to pay down debt."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8653> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasIdentifier> "FP8653" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8653> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "FP8653" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8653> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#hadPrimarySource> <https://iris.thegiin.org/metric/5.3/FP8653/> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8653> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "This metric is intended to capture the organization’s cumulative earnings recognized in the organization's income statements which have not been paid to the owners of the organization as dividends.\n\nRetained earnings is also sometimes termed retained capital, accumulated earnings, or retained surplus. Organizations should report retained earnings as of the end of the reporting period."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8653> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#definedBy> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#giin> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8653> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasSpecification> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8653> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP8653> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP9049> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP9049> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#Code> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP9049> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasName> "Cost of Goods Sold" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP9049> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Cost of Goods Sold"@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP9049> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasDescription> "This metric is intended to capture the organization’s operating efficiency.\nValue of direct expenditures attributable to the production of goods sold by the organization during the reporting period." .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP9049> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "This metric is intended to capture the organization’s operating efficiency.\nValue of direct expenditures attributable to the production of goods sold by the organization during the reporting period."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP9049> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasIdentifier> "FP9049" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP9049> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#hadPrimarySource> <https://iris.thegiin.org/metric/5.3/FP9049/> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP9049> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "This metric is intended to capture all costs of purchase, costs of conversion, and other direct costs incurred in the production and sale of the organization's products."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP9049> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#definedBy> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#giin> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP9049> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasSpecification> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP9049> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#FP9049> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53> .
