<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#ID9608> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#ID9608> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#Code> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#ID9608> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasName> "Assets Under Management: Total" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#ID9608> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Assets Under Management: Total"@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#ID9608> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasDescription> "Value of the investing organization's total assets under management as of the end of the reporting period." .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#ID9608> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Value of the investing organization's total assets under management as of the end of the reporting period."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#ID9608> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasIdentifier> "ID9608" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#ID9608> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "ID9608" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#ID9608> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#hadPrimarySource> <https://iris.thegiin.org/metric/5.3/ID9608/> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#ID9608> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "Organizations should footnote all assumptions used."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#ID9608> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "This metric is intended to capture the value (in currency) of an investor's assets under management."@en .
