<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#OD3520> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Year the organization was founded."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#OD3520> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasIdentifier> "OD3520" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#OD3520> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "OD3520" .
