<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#OD5828> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "Organizations should footnote all assumptions used."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#OD5828> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "This metric is intended to capture a widely recognized name for the organization, such as its legal name."@en .
