<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#OD6855> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasDescription> "Address of the organization's legally incorporated headquarters." .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#OD6855> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Address of the organization's legally incorporated headquarters."@en .
