<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#OD6855> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "This metric is intended to capture the organization’s headquarters location. The term “headquarters” denotes the location where most, if not all, of the important functions of an organization are coordinated. Organizations are encouraged to include the full address of the headquarters including Street Name and Number, District/City, Postal Code, and Country."@en .
