<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#OD6951> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasName> "Report Start Date" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#OD6951> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Report Start Date"@en .
