<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#OD7111> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#Code> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#OD7111> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasName> "Report End Date" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#OD7111> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Report End Date"@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#OD7111> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasDescription> "End date of the reporting period for which the organization is providing data." .
