<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#OD7111> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "This metric is intended to capture the end point of the time period for which reported data applies. This metric should be used in conjunction with Report Start Date (OD6951)."@en .
