<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#OD7536> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#Code> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#OD7536> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasName> "Water Type" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#OD7536> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Water Type"@en .
