<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#OD7796> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasDescription> "Web address (URL) of the organization." .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#OD7796> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Web address (URL) of the organization."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#OD7796> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasIdentifier> "OD7796" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#OD7796> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "OD7796" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#OD7796> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#hadPrimarySource> <https://iris.thegiin.org/metric/5.3/OD7796/> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#OD7796> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "Organizations should footnote all assumptions used."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#OD7796> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "This metric is intended to capture the primary website address (URL) where the organization offers public-facing information about itself."@en .
