<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#OI3324> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#OI3324> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#Code> .
