<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#PD6596> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasDescription> "Amount of energy consumed by the product during its lifetime." .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#PD6596> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Amount of energy consumed by the product during its lifetime."@en .
