<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#PD6596> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "PD6596" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#PD6596> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#hadPrimarySource> <https://iris.thegiin.org/metric/5.3/PD6596/> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#PD6596> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "Organizations should footnote assumptions used with respect to product utilization. See usage guidance for further information."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#PD6596> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "This metric is intended to capture energy consumed by an individual product over its lifetime, not energy consumed by the product during the reporting period. It can offer an estimate of efficiency gains associated with the product.\n\nExamples of assumptions related to product utilization, to footnote, include hours used and watts/hour used."@en .
