<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#PD6806> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "This metric is intended to capture the regional geography of clients. In countries where state postal abbreviations exist, use standard and appropriate codes (e.g., New York, USA = NY or Andhra Pradesh, India = AP)."@en .
