<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#PD9337> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#Code> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#PD9337> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasName> "Compulsory Deposits" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#PD9337> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Compulsory Deposits"@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#PD9337> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#hasDescription> "Indicates whether the organization requires clients to establish savings accounts." .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#PD9337> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Indicates whether the organization requires clients to establish savings accounts."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#PD9337> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasIdentifier> "PD9337" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#PD9337> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "PD9337" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#PD9337> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#hadPrimarySource> <https://iris.thegiin.org/metric/5.3/PD9337/> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#PD9337> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "Organizations should footnote the details of this requirement, including which clients it applies to."@en .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#PD9337> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "This metric is intended to capture whether or not the organization requires some or all of its clients to have deposits with the organization (savings accounts)."@en .
