<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#PI4060> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ontology.commonapproach.org/cids#Code> .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/IrisMetric53#PI4060> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#hasName> "Client Individuals: Total" .
